{
  "version": "v1",
  "description": "Keyword vocabulary v1. 'world' facets describe the PROBLEM SIDE (what the input is, what can happen to it, what is asked, one structural twist). They deliberately contain no solution techniques. 'technique' is the legacy-style baseline vocabulary used only for comparison experiments. 'mutation' is used for the controlled escape-from-known-problem redraw.",
